title: Feminism
new-page: true
on-arrival: month_actions += 1; feminism_timer +=6
is-card: true
card-image: img/kpd_women.jpg
frequency: 100
tags: party_affairs
view-if: women_connection

= Feminism

A Marxist party that excludes women is no Marxist party at all. Still, the dominance of men in both leadership and representation alienate women. How will we deal with this?

- @leadership: Push for more women in local and national leadership.
- @campaign_women: Include and acknowledge the voices of women within our media and propaganda
- @message_change: Change our rhetoric to appeal to the new women.
- @nothing: We can pospone this matter

@leadership
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; women_connection += 2; left_opposition_dissent += 6; right_opposition_dissent += 6; marxist_leninist_dissent += 6; conciliator_dissent += 6

We have increased leadership positions for women. Some of them replaced male leaders, leaving some discontent.

@campaign_women
title: Include and acknowledge the voices of women within our media and propaganda
subtitle: -1 resources
choose-if: resources >= 1
unavailable-subtitle: Not enough resources.
on-arrival: resources -= 1; women_connection += 1; new_middle_kpd += 4*(1-dissent); workers_kpd -= 4*(1-dissent); new_middle_kpd -= 2 if message_change <2; workers_kpd -= 2 if message_change <2; 

We change and create newspapers and posters to address women specifically. Some of these are even written by women. [? if women_connection <2: Our current messaging does not particularly appeal to women, especially those of the new middle class.][? if message_change >=2: Our change in rhetoric attracts even the women of the new middle class.]

@message_change
subtitle: This may anger our more hardline communists.
on-arrival: women_connection += 1; left_opposition_dissent += 10; marxist_leninist_dissent += 10; message_change +=1

We try to target the women of the new middle class, also known as "new women". While effective at expanding our base, many believe to be dilluting our class character.

@nothing
title: We can pospone this matter

We have decided to postpone this matter for later, hopefully it doesn't backfire...

- @return: Continue...